    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 300023,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": null,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "originalText": "图中假设 Store 有完整 H，P / D 初始未命中，D 保留 H；采用块对齐、兼容布局。\nP 部分命中时 D→P 仅传缺失 H；D 未保留完整 H 时 P→D 仅补实际缺失 H + U。",
